Important note on consent
-------------------------

`data/features.jsonl` may contain rows derived from `human_real` (real,
consented human browsing) sessions. Every such row originated from a
session whose consent text (see DATASHEET.md §3) explicitly permits
public release. The release-build pipeline (`benchmark/release/`) filters
out sessions whose consent does not cover redistribution; see
`data/excluded.json` in this release for the audit trail.

No raw IP addresses, raw User-Agent strings, request bodies, or
authorization / cookie values are present in any released file. See
`DATASHEET.md` §4 (Preprocessing / Cleaning / Labeling) for the
anonymization detail and the scrub gate that hard-blocks release if
any of those surfaces leak.
